---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';

// === Sony - Summer w/ Xperia - faithful rebuild of monuments.cc/portfolio/sonys-summer-with-xperia ===
// Real campaign stills pulled from the live site into /public/case-studies/sony-xperia-summer.
const g = Array.from({ length: 14 }, (_, i) => `/case-studies/sony-xperia-summer/gallery/xp-${String(i + 1).padStart(2, '0')}.jpg`);
const meta = [
  { k: 'Client', v: 'Sony Xperia' },
  { k: 'Agency', v: 'Art of Visuals' },
  { k: 'Director / Creative Director', v: 'DJ Ramirez' },
  { k: 'DP', v: 'Komin Kovatonic' },
  { k: 'Stills', v: 'DJ Ramirez' },
  { k: 'Deliverables', v: 'Videography · Photography · Amplification' },
];
---
<Base title="Sony · Summer w/ Xperia · monuments">
  <article class="bc-page">

    <!-- HERO (full-bleed image) -->
    <header class="bc-hero">
      <img class="bc-hero-img" src={g[0]} alt="Sony Summer with Xperia campaign" />
      <div class="bc-hero-inner">
        <p class="bc-hero-eyebrow">Sony Xperia · Directing, Photo + Strategy</p>
        <h1 class="bc-hero-title">Summer<br>w/ Xperia</h1>
        <p class="bc-hero-lede">A summer in motion, shot on the Xperia 5 IV.</p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- IMPACT (results first, from the Xperia PRO-I launch report) -->
    <section class="bc-impact fade" aria-label="Campaign results">
      <div class="bc-impact-in">
        <div class="bc-impact-item"><span class="bc-impact-n">3.6M</span><span class="bc-impact-l">Impressions</span></div>
        <div class="bc-impact-item"><span class="bc-impact-n">569K</span><span class="bc-impact-l">Actions taken</span></div>
        <div class="bc-impact-item"><span class="bc-impact-n">15.54%</span><span class="bc-impact-l">Engagement rate</span></div>
      </div>
      <p class="bc-impact-cap">Measured on the Xperia PRO-I launch, the same partnership · industry calls 3.5 to 6% high · AOV channels + amplification</p>
    </section>

    <!-- INTRO -->
    <section class="bc-intro fade">
      <p>Sony kept coming back to Art of Visuals for its Xperia launches, and I creative directed the run: the PRO-I, the 1 III, and a summer with the 5 IV. The mission never changed: show that a phone can hold cinema-grade work in real life, not in a lab, and capture the magic of summer through the lens of Xperia.</p>
    </section>

    <!-- FILM: the actual launch spot -->
    <section class="bc-film fade" aria-label="Campaign film">
      <div class="bc-film-frame" id="xpFilm">
        <button class="bc-film-poster" id="xpPlay" type="button" aria-label="Play the Xperia launch film">
          <img src={g[6]} alt="Sony Xperia launch film" loading="lazy" />
          <span class="bc-film-pill">Play · The Spot</span>
        </button>
      </div>
      <p class="bc-film-cap">The launch film · Sony's Xperia PRO-I: A Cinematographer's Dream</p>
    </section>

    <!-- THE PARTNERSHIP -->
    <section class="bc-exec fade">
      <h2 class="bc-exec-h">One partnership, a run of launches.</h2>
      <div class="bc-exec-b">
        <p>For the Xperia PRO-I we opened with a first look film, A Cinematographer's Dream, then kept the story going for six months: travel vlogs, mobile photography, four highlight videos, and 50+ images distributed across AOV's channels, from posts and Stories to Reels, IGTV, and YouTube. That launch alone made 3.6 million impressions and 569 thousand actions, with an engagement rate more than triple what industry standards consider high.</p>
        <p>The Xperia 1 III got the same treatment over four months: a first look, a short documentary shot on the phone, a Sedona takeover, and 24 hours in NYC. Summer with Xperia was the next chapter of that run, built on everything the launches taught us.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SHOT -->
    <figure class="bc-shot fade">
      <img src={g[1]} alt="Summer with Xperia, golden hour" loading="lazy" />
    </figure>

    <!-- STRATEGY -->
    <section class="bc-exec fade">
      <h2 class="bc-exec-h">The ultimate adventure companion.</h2>
      <div class="bc-exec-b">
        <p>We developed a strategy focused on positioning the Xperia 5 IV as a phone that could keep up with any journey. From the start, our goal was to showcase how the Xperia's advanced camera features made it perfect for capturing everyday life moments. In collaboration with Art of Visuals, we launched Summer with Xperia, a series of videos highlighting the phone's cinema-quality capabilities.</p>
        <p>Sony sent over the Xperia 5 IV early, giving me time to test the camera, work out any bugs, and understand its strengths so we could maximize its potential in each shot.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CAMPAIGN PAIR -->
    <div class="bc-duo fade">
      <img src={g[2]} alt="Summer with Xperia" loading="lazy" />
      <img src={g[3]} alt="Summer with Xperia" loading="lazy" />
    </div>

    <!-- PLANNING & DIRECTION -->
    <section class="bc-exec fade">
      <h2 class="bc-exec-h">Scripted to feel like a real summer.</h2>
      <div class="bc-exec-b">
        <p>Together with the team, I scripted and directed each shoot, focusing on scenes that felt true to a real summer: beach sunsets, road trips, and unexpected adventures. The goal was to show how easily the Xperia could capture beautiful, spontaneous moments.</p>
        <p>Each video emphasized the Xperia 5 IV's high-res imaging and vivid colors, showcasing the phone's ability to create a cinematic feel without any extra equipment.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CAMPAIGN PAIR 2 -->
    <div class="bc-duo fade">
      <img src={g[4]} alt="Summer with Xperia" loading="lazy" />
      <img src={g[5]} alt="Summer with Xperia" loading="lazy" />
    </div>

    <!-- INSIGHT QUOTE -->
    <section class="bc-quote fade">
      <p>We transformed the Xperia 5 IV from a smartphone into <span class="bc-quote-em">a storytelling device</span>, a summer staple for creators worldwide.</p>
      <p class="bc-quote-attr">The campaign impact.</p>
    </section>

    <!-- SHOT -->
    <figure class="bc-shot fade">
      <img src={g[7]} alt="Summer with Xperia" loading="lazy" />
    </figure>

    <!-- EARLY BIRD -->
    <section class="bc-exec fade">
      <h2 class="bc-exec-h">The early bird gets the phone.</h2>
      <div class="bc-exec-b">
        <p>Before launch, Sony provided us with early access to the Xperia 5 IV to experience its functionality firsthand. This early look gave us valuable time to test the camera's full range: identifying its strengths, pinpointing areas to troubleshoot, and aligning our strategy with the Xperia's standout qualities.</p>
        <p>While directing the campaign, I kept my camera close, shooting behind-the-scenes and capturing the Xperia 5 IV in action. I snapped everything, from the phone handling to those perfect golden-hour shots to candid moments. For me, it was about capturing the vibe of the season.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CAMPAIGN PAIR 3 -->
    <div class="bc-duo fade">
      <img src={g[8]} alt="Summer with Xperia" loading="lazy" />
      <img src={g[9]} alt="Summer with Xperia" loading="lazy" />
    </div>

    <!-- CAMPAIGN PAIR 4 -->
    <div class="bc-duo fade">
      <img src={g[10]} alt="Summer with Xperia" loading="lazy" />
      <img src={g[12]} alt="Summer with Xperia" loading="lazy" />
    </div>

    <!-- FINAL SHOT -->
    <figure class="bc-shot fade">
      <img src={g[13]} alt="Summer with Xperia" loading="lazy" />
    </figure>

    <!-- META -->
    <div class="bc-meta fade">
      {meta.map((m) => (
        <div class="cs-meta-item">
          <span class="cs-meta-k">{m.k}</span>
          <span class="cs-meta-v">{m.v}</span>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <!-- NEXT -->
    <a class="cs-next" href="/work/clothing-merch">
      <span class="cs-next-k">Next project</span>
      <span class="cs-next-t">Clothing &amp; Merch <span class="cs-next-arrow">→</span></span>
    </a>

  </article>

  <script is:inline>
    // Click-to-play film block: poster (real campaign still) until the spot is requested,
    // then swap in the privacy-enhanced YouTube embed. No timers, no autoplay before click.
    (function () {
      var btn = document.getElementById('xpPlay');
      var frame = document.getElementById('xpFilm');
      if (!btn || !frame) return;
      btn.addEventListener('click', function () {
        var ifr = document.createElement('iframe');
        ifr.src = 'https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/_RGvpwyYLTI?autoplay=1&rel=0&modestbranding=1&playsinline=1';
        ifr.title = "Sony's Xperia PRO-I: A Cinematographer's Dream, the launch film";
        ifr.setAttribute('allow', 'autoplay; encrypted-media; picture-in-picture; fullscreen');
        ifr.setAttribute('allowfullscreen', '');
        // inline pointer-events beats the Lenis "iframe { pointer-events:none }" rule
        ifr.setAttribute('style', 'position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;border:0;pointer-events:auto;');
        frame.replaceChildren(ifr);
      }, { once: true });
    })();
  </script>
</Base>

<style>
  /* Results band: dark like .bc-quote so it reads as one system with the page. */
  .bc-impact { background: #0d0f14; color: var(--white); padding: clamp(52px, 7vw, 88px) var(--pad); }
  .bc-impact-in { max-width: var(--wrap); margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 40px; }
  .bc-impact-n { display: block; font-weight: 600; font-size: clamp(42px, 6vw, 86px); letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1; }
  .bc-impact-l { display: block; margin-top: 12px; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.22em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(252, 252, 252, 0.55); }
  .bc-impact-cap { max-width: var(--wrap); margin: 40px auto 0; font-family: var(--mono2); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(252, 252, 252, 0.45); }

  /* Film block: 16:9 poster frame, mono pill, iframe swapped in on click. */
  .bc-film { max-width: var(--wrap); margin: 0 auto 26px; padding: 0 var(--pad); }
  .bc-film-frame { position: relative; aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; background: #0d0f14; border-radius: 2px; overflow: hidden; }
  .bc-film-poster { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block; padding: 0; border: 0; background: none; cursor: pointer; }
  .bc-film-poster img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; filter: brightness(0.76); transition: transform 0.7s ease, filter 0.4s ease; }
  .bc-film-poster:hover img { transform: scale(1.025); filter: brightness(0.9); }
  .bc-film-pill { position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); font-family: var(--mono2); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.16em; text-transform: uppercase; white-space: nowrap; color: var(--white); border: 1px solid rgba(252, 252, 252, 0.65); border-radius: 999px; padding: 13px 24px; background: rgba(13, 15, 20, 0.45); backdrop-filter: blur(6px); transition: background 0.3s ease, color 0.3s ease; }
  .bc-film-poster:hover .bc-film-pill { background: var(--white); color: #0d0f14; }
  .bc-film-cap { margin-top: 12px; font-family: var(--mono2); font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(20, 21, 25, 0.55); }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .bc-impact { padding: 48px 24px; }
    .bc-impact-in { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 28px; }
    .bc-film { padding: 0 24px; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .bc-film-poster img, .bc-film-pill { transition: none; }
    .bc-film-poster:hover img { transform: none; }
  }
</style>
